Project Demonstration Phase
LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

Project Demonstration Phase

1. Introduction

The Project Demonstration Phase is the final stage of the LegalEase project. In this phase, the completed application is presented to faculty, evaluators, or other stakeholders to demonstrate its features, workflow, technical implementation, and results.

The demonstration shows how a user can select a document type, enter information, generate an AI-assisted draft, review it, edit it, and download the document.

> LegalEase is demonstrated as an AI-assisted legal document drafting tool. The generated document is a draft and should be reviewed carefully; it is not a substitute for professional legal advice.




---

