4. Project Introduction

During the demonstration, begin by explaining:

> “Our project is LegalEase, an AI-Powered Legal Document Generator. The main purpose of this project is to simplify the preparation of basic legal document drafts using artificial intelligence. Users can select a document type, enter the required information, and generate a structured draft that can be reviewed, edited, and downloaded.”




