24. Suggested Presentation Script

You can use this short script during your final demonstration:

> “Good morning everyone. Our project is LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator. The main objective of this project is to simplify basic legal document drafting using artificial intelligence.

First, the user selects the required document type. Next, the user enters the necessary information through a simple form. The information is validated and sent to the backend, which communicates with the AI model. The AI generates a structured document draft.

The generated document is then displayed on the preview page. The user can review, edit, regenerate, and download the document in the supported format.

We have also implemented input validation, error handling, security practices, and testing. LegalEase is intended as an AI-assisted drafting tool, so generated documents should be carefully reviewed and are not a replacement for professional legal advice.

In the future, the project can be enhanced with multilingual support, voice input, document history, more document types, jurisdiction-specific support, and professional review features. Thank you.”




