26. Conclusion

The Project Demonstration Phase presents the completed LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator as a working application.

The demonstration proves the complete workflow:

Select Document → Enter Information → AI Generation → Preview → Edit → Download

It also demonstrates the project's technical implementation, testing, advantages, limitations, and future possibilities. This final phase allows evaluators to understand both how the system works and how AI can assist with basic legal document drafting in a responsible manner.
